  "native_semantics": [
    "Eight record-score entries share an exact normalized30-instruction template: WORD type, BYTE status/metric,264-byte stride,DWORD nonzero gate; full signed result10-floor(metric/10)",
    "All record/grid address arithmetic wraps32 bits; no new range validation is added; grid predicate reads BYTE at index*388 and DWORD cells at x+228*y+origin",
    "Lowio table contains64 pointer slots, capacity and errors are DWORD; records are8 bytes, only handle/flags/text_state are initialized, reservedWORD untouched",
    "Handle accessor uses unsigned capacity bound then native signed SAR for block index; invalid result is ffffffff and both error stores are DWORD",
    "Inherited blob is countDWORD, count BYTE flags, count DWORD handles; handle base uses original count before signed2048 cap; negative count skips inheritance",
    "Inherited acceptance uses captured handle/flags but reloads accepted payload and block after GetFileType; standard record is captured across APIs and block0 reloads for next descriptor",
    "Initial allocation failure calls error27 then continues using original allocation if callback returns; extra allocation failure limits inheritance to current capacity",
    "Native block bound is recomputed from actual table slot after every initialized record; filetype acceptance uses fullDWORD before lowBYTE device-type decision"
  ],
